            "title": "An evening at Valle dei Templi, Agrigento",
            "summary": "As we arrive in the parking lot, there's dust everywhere. Although it's early august and Ferragosto has not yet started it feels like the whole of Italy has planned to come here today. There are cars everywhere, and -in typical Sicilian fashion-, hardly any road signage to&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>As we arrive in the parking lot, there's dust everywhere. Although it's early august and <em>Ferragosto </em>has not yet started it feels like the whole of Italy has planned to come here today. There are cars everywhere, and -in typical Sicilian fashion-, hardly any road signage to tell you where to go, or even how to pay for the parking. </p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://leonfassbender.com/media/posts/10/9e31b408-fce9-498a-a591-871a6e9e44ed_rw_1920.jpeg\" alt=\"A view over Agrigento \" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" srcset=\"https://leonfassbender.com/media/posts/10/responsive/9e31b408-fce9-498a-a591-871a6e9e44ed_rw_1920-xs.webp 640w ,https://leonfassbender.com/media/posts/10/responsive/9e31b408-fce9-498a-a591-871a6e9e44ed_rw_1920-sm.webp 768w ,https://leonfassbender.com/media/posts/10/responsive/9e31b408-fce9-498a-a591-871a6e9e44ed_rw_1920-md.webp 1024w ,https://leonfassbender.com/media/posts/10/responsive/9e31b408-fce9-498a-a591-871a6e9e44ed_rw_1920-lg.webp 1366w ,https://leonfassbender.com/media/posts/10/responsive/9e31b408-fce9-498a-a591-871a6e9e44ed_rw_1920-xl.webp 1600w ,https://leonfassbender.com/media/posts/10/responsive/9e31b408-fce9-498a-a591-871a6e9e44ed_rw_1920-2xl.webp 1920w\">\n<figcaption>Caption</figcaption>\n</figure>",
